Subject: [PATCH 4/9] net: reconcile CVITEK ioctl and stmmac support

Keep the vendor user/compat ifreq API and CVITEK stmmac DT setup while adopting stable socket ioctl command validation, direct IPv4 gifconf handling, ethtool copy fixes and the remaining 5.10.265 networking updates.
